      "settings": {
        "model_lede": "Nationally, just 20% of prison-leavers are in work six weeks after release, and the proven reoffending rate is almost 30% (MoJ, 2024–25). Practical, accredited skills change those odds. Built for prison industries and education teams: we install the workshop, train your staff to deliver the course, and support your first cohorts — then the capability stays in-house.",
        "budget_lede": "Reoffending costs the public purse £40,000+ per person per year (MoJ). Against that, the numbers below are small — and cohorts at existing sites have been grant-funded in full or in part. We'll help you make the case."
      }
    }
  },
  "order": [
    "main"
  ]
}
